Hi Andrew,

I am not using oligo but if you have an ExpressionSet object xs
containing data on log2 scale, then the values on linear scale
will simply be

2^exprs(xs)

Note that this is exponentiation not squaring: 2^x and not x^2.

Cheers,

 - axel


