Dear Sunny,

I think a better approach would be to use a package like pvclust.
Pvclust creates a hierarchical clustering (a tree), and at each node
computes a p-value; therefore, the criterion to choose certain
clusters can be defined by a threshold p value.

See http://www.is.titech.ac.jp/~shimo/prog/pvclust/ for details.

Best regards,

January

