>     Ctrl            -1           -1
>     Chlr1            1            0
>     Chlr2            0            1
>   >  xFit2=eBayes(xFit
> xFit
>   >  xFit2=eBayes(xFit,contmat)

There are no arguments for eBayes() that take a contrasts matrix, so I 
am not sure what you are trying to do here. You want to do the usual:

xFit2 <- contrasts.fit(xFit, contmat)
xFit2 <- eBayes(xFit2)

Best,

Jim



